DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Butas na po yan.

3824
02:19:20,400 --> 02:19:22,420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun din po yung ating North

3825
02:19:22,720 --> 02:19:27,020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Avenue hanggang Tandang Sora ho yata, 100% na rin po 'yan.

3826
02:19:27,340 --> 02:19:27,860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tuloy-tuloy.

3827
02:19:28,120 --> 02:19:31,340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Then yung ating Camp Aguinaldo, papuntang Anona sa Casio,

3828
02:19:31,700 --> 02:19:34,340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think around 90% na po yung tunnel natin dyan.

3829
02:19:34,640 --> 02:19:39,080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So talagang yung butas, kung hindi man 100%,

3830
02:19:39,080 --> 02:19:43,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: there's a significant progress po sa pagtatunnel natin sa mga ganitong subway po.

3831
02:19:43,880 --> 02:19:46,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And what is the target date of completion?

3832
02:19:47,500 --> 02:19:48,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Operation.

3833
02:19:48,060 --> 02:19:50,840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Operation is around 2031 po.

3834
02:19:51,000 --> 02:19:51,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 2031.

3835
02:19:52,720 --> 02:19:54,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Lastly, dahil pinapahinto na ako,

3836
02:19:54,880 --> 02:20:02,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung concern lang dito sa ginagawa natin sa may line that runs through itong Commonwealth Avenue.

3837
02:20:03,400 --> 02:20:15,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Meron tayong, I think, there's a terminal that will be placed sa may papasok ng University Avenue,

3838
02:20:15,340 --> 02:20:17,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: papasok ng UP doon sa labas.

3839
02:20:17,580 --> 02:20:22,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I think this is kung saan malapit, almost katapat ng University Mall,

3840
02:20:22,720 --> 02:20:35,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: but yung initial plan was ang entrance and exit was nasa side lang ng UP

3841
02:20:35,800 --> 02:20:39,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at wala doon sa kabilang side ng Commonwealth.

3842
02:20:39,800 --> 02:20:42,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That was the initial plans that I think that was presented.

3843
02:20:42,960 --> 02:20:49,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: At ang concern was why couldn't it be on both sides?

3844
02:20:49,400 --> 02:20:54,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos I think UP raised the concern kasi ang initial plans was yung,

3845
02:20:54,520 --> 02:21:07,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: elevated yung terminal at hindi underground kasi yung that line goes under the Quezon Memorial Circle

3846
02:21:07,240 --> 02:21:15,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: then pumupunta sa, yun nga, lalabas sa Commonwealth, bakit kailangan sa taas yung...

3847
02:21:15,880 --> 02:21:23,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I may answer po, we're referring to the MRT-7 po, University Station.

3848
02:21:23,780 --> 02:21:26,220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think a few months back.

3849
02:21:26,440 --> 02:21:31,020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We had a meeting with the UP also po, okay, with the President, Atty. Jimenez,

3850
02:21:31,020 --> 02:21:34,140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at nagpapasalamat kami at nagkasundo na po kami.

3851
02:21:34,140 --> 02:21:38,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Una po, to address the situation, dalawa po, northbound and southbound.

3852
02:21:38,760 --> 02:21:42,040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Bali eh, hindi po, eastbound and westbound po.

3853
02:21:42,040 --> 02:21:46,280
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung isa po ay bababa sa tingin namin doon sa may techno hub

3854
02:21:46,280 --> 02:21:49,360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para we can cover as many commuters as possible.

3855
02:21:49,360 --> 02:21:55,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung isa po, yung papuntang westbound, ay the eastbound, bababa naman doon yung sa University Mall.

3856
02:21:56,280 --> 02:21:57,540
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung isa po yung napakasunduan namin.

3857
02:21:58,060 --> 02:21:59,500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And it's elevated po.

3858
02:21:59,860 --> 02:22:03,920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kung anong design na gusto po ng UP, ay susundan po namin.

3859
02:22:04,420 --> 02:22:08,620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Isang rason kung bakit po hindi kami pumayag na maging underground.

3860
02:22:09,160 --> 02:22:11,080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang Commonwealth po, napaka-traffic.

3861
02:22:11,900 --> 02:22:14,220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Imagine nyo po yan kapag ginawa nating underground,

3862
02:22:14,360 --> 02:22:17,060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: and we're trying to hit the target po na 2027,

3863
02:22:17,500 --> 02:22:19,360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: paano po yung cut and cover natin dyan?

3864
02:22:21,300 --> 02:22:25,820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We're just saying na, paano po, we're going to stop traffic doon sa UP.

3865
02:22:26,280 --> 02:22:27,680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Because we want to do it underground.

3866
02:22:28,100 --> 02:22:32,180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So I think the most practical way of addressing this is to elevate it.

3867
02:22:32,180 --> 02:22:34,180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Since elevated naman po lahat, halos,

3868
02:22:34,520 --> 02:22:39,060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: and we'll make sure that the design as wanted by UP, we'll just adopt it.

3869
02:22:39,160 --> 02:22:41,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. So at least yun yung importante para sa akin,

3870
02:22:42,040 --> 02:22:44,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at napakasunduan nyo na ni Press Gigi,

3871
02:22:44,920 --> 02:22:47,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: because he also raised this concern sa akin,

3872
02:22:48,120 --> 02:22:50,480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung kung saan ilalagay yung stasyon,

3873
02:22:50,660 --> 02:22:53,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at he wanted to make sure that it goes out both sides.

3874
02:22:54,700 --> 02:22:55,880
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Opo. Salamat po.

3875
02:22:56,280 --> 02:22:57,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. Maraming salamat.

3876
02:23:00,040 --> 02:23:01,460
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you very much, Kong Bong Suntay.

3877
02:23:02,880 --> 02:23:04,040
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Two minutes suspension.

3878
02:30:56,780 --> 02:31:01,960
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Good afternoon. Next to interpolate is Congresswoman Anna York-Bondoc.

3879
02:31:01,960 --> 02:31:10,120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairs and members of the DOTR family.

3880
02:31:10,700 --> 02:31:14,080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Honorable Secretary, magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat.

3881
02:31:15,020 --> 02:31:23,700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I come from the 4th District of Pampanga at dun po ang San Simón Tulaok exit po

3882
02:31:23,700 --> 02:31:27,960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and the toll plaza ng atin pong NLEX.

3883
02:31:29,220 --> 02:31:36,220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Last week, actually up to this week, from Friday until Tuesday, and today lang po, slight improvement,

3884
02:31:36,760 --> 02:31:45,120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: the passengers and commuters on the NLEX northbound and southbound suffered 10 kilometers traffic

3885
02:31:45,120 --> 02:31:47,580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and 10 to 12 hours delay.

3886
02:31:48,380 --> 02:31:52,300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Secretary, honorable members, Mr. Chairman,

3887
02:31:52,300 --> 02:31:54,300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: grabe po ang nangyari sa mga tao.

3888
02:31:55,980 --> 02:32:00,220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: People were stuck in their cars for 10 to 12 hours, unable to eat.

3889
02:32:00,800 --> 02:32:08,080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Marami pong nag-CR na lang po along the highway, male and female, I am sorry to let you know, including seniors.

3890
02:32:08,740 --> 02:32:15,500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And there were a number of very sick people po, yung mga nangangailangan po talaga, who suffered so much.

3891
02:32:16,200 --> 02:32:20,260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: As the Chairman of the TRB, could you comment on this and what are your plans?

3892
02:32:20,260 --> 02:32:32,260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Salamat po, Mr. Chairman, tama po, we commiserate with all the motorists who were stranded during ito po, pagbabaha sa San Simón po natin.

3893
02:32:32,260 --> 02:32:44,780
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Nung nalaman po natin itong pangyayari, hinatasan po natin ng TRB na magbigay ng notice to explain kaagad sa NLEX, para alamin kung ano talaga nangyari.

3894
02:32:44,780 --> 02:32:48,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Other than that, there's another memo

3895
02:32:48,760 --> 02:32:49,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: that was issued also by the TRB.

3896
02:32:49,760 --> 02:33:01,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And this is more of, sabihin natin, to study the possibility, to reimburse, kahit pa paano yung manay-stranded sa traffic, kahit pa mas lalo na yung nag-turn back.

3897
02:33:02,380 --> 02:33:05,060
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po, may dalawa pong bagay that we have to address.

3898
02:33:05,600 --> 02:33:08,740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yung una is the infrastructure itself.

3899
02:33:09,220 --> 02:33:11,340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung anong pong magagawa ng TRB?

3900
02:33:11,920 --> 02:33:15,080
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang TRB po kasi is composed of different agencies po.

3901
02:33:15,080 --> 02:33:19,320
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang nangunguna po dyan is the DOTR, kami po eh for the toll setting.

3902
02:33:19,760 --> 02:33:24,000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At DPWH po, para tamang infrastructure po doon.

3903
02:33:24,300 --> 02:33:30,620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaapon po, nagpulong na po si Secretary Vince, kasama po ang TRB, kasama din po ang NLEX doon.

3904
02:33:30,920 --> 02:33:36,620
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At mayroong mga plano na po na gagawin, short-term, mid-term, and long-term po.

3905
02:33:37,040 --> 02:33:44,760
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At I was not able to attend the meeting po, andun po si Executive Director JR Tugade.

3906
02:33:44,760 --> 02:33:49,400
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: If I may just say po, in a nutshell, yung mga napag-usapan.

3907
02:33:49,760 --> 02:33:54,120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Could you share with us the short, medium, and long-term plans po na pinag-usapan?

3908
02:33:55,990 --> 02:33:58,510
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And how soon po can we execute these?

3909
02:33:59,810 --> 02:34:06,290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung napag-usapan din po, at ito yung mga plano po ng DPWH kasama po ang TRB.

3910
02:34:06,890 --> 02:34:15,250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang una po yung pagtataas ng Tulaok Pavement by 0.6 meters northbound and 0.5 meters southbound.

3911
02:34:15,250 --> 02:34:16,470
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito yung mga short-term nila.

3912
02:34:17,170 --> 02:34:20,190
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: NLEX Design and Construct Perimeter Floodwall.

3913
02:34:21,010 --> 02:34:23,890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: DPWH po to dredge Tulaok.

3914
02:34:24,630 --> 02:34:28,010
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dredge both trench parallel to NLEX, dito po yung sa gilid.

3915
02:34:28,690 --> 02:34:34,230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Install floodgate and sheet pile to prevent backflow from Tulaok River, both sides of NLEX.

3916
02:34:34,710 --> 02:34:39,750
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Deploy heavy-duty siphoning pumps at the trenches to manage the collected water.

3917
02:34:39,750 --> 02:34:47,570
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ito po yung mga sinabmit sa akin ni ED Tugade na maplaplanuhin po ng DPWH kasama po yung NLEX.

3918
02:34:48,050 --> 02:34:50,750
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang long-term po nila is to repair collapses.

3919
02:34:51,010 --> 02:34:56,230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Portion of dike along San Jose at saka dito po sa San Simon.

3920
02:34:56,810 --> 02:35:00,990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Construction of retarding basin po, impounding detention ponds.

3921
02:35:01,510 --> 02:35:02,210
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Naku po ito.

3922
02:35:03,170 --> 02:35:03,530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po.

3923
02:35:04,070 --> 02:35:11,530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And meron din pong construction of floodway po, from Arayat to Manila.

3924
02:35:11,530 --> 02:35:16,670
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ito po yung overall na plano ng DPWH as part of TRB po.

3925
02:35:17,030 --> 02:35:19,850
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa panig naman po ng DOTR.

3926
02:35:20,170 --> 02:35:20,530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ito po yung...

3927
02:35:21,010 --> 02:35:23,330
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang concern namin is more of the motorists.

3928
02:35:23,790 --> 02:35:31,630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So ang inutus po natin sa NLEX, sa mga ganitong pangyayari, inutusan natin ng NLEX na mag-short message na po.

3929
02:35:31,630 --> 02:35:33,630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I-text na po lahat ang mga motorista.

3930
02:35:34,510 --> 02:35:35,630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mas lalo na po yung may RFID.

3931
02:35:36,750 --> 02:35:38,210
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi meron naman silang numero.

3932
02:35:38,650 --> 02:35:40,650
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So we just have to be proactive.

3933
02:35:41,250 --> 02:35:44,750
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi po natin sinasabi na kasalanan ng NLEX yung pagbabaha.

3934
02:35:45,390 --> 02:35:49,390
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Yesterday po we appealed to them na magbigay kayo ng toll-free.

3935
02:35:50,350 --> 02:35:50,630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And it will be...

3936
02:35:51,010 --> 02:35:53,330
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Part of your corporate social responsibility.

3937
02:35:53,530 --> 02:35:54,910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At pumayag naman po sila.

3938
02:35:55,230 --> 02:36:01,030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Moving forward, we expect them na they can basically naman malalaman kung bahana yung mga area na yun.

3939
02:36:01,030 --> 02:36:06,030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And they just have to be proactive in informing our motorists na...

3940
02:36:06,930 --> 02:36:11,090
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Actually po, yung nakalagay sa sulat, mga three hours before sana, sabihan na.

3941
02:36:11,450 --> 02:36:13,830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Na certain areas hindi po madadaanan.

3942
02:36:14,650 --> 02:36:16,250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So hopefully gagawin ng NLEX.

3943
02:36:16,430 --> 02:36:20,030
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sinabi naman po nila na sila'y tutupad dito sa...

3944
02:36:21,010 --> 02:36:23,530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: They committed to comply with this directive.

3945
02:36:24,030 --> 02:36:31,050
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi ngayon po merong mga sinasabi ng variable bit-bulitin yata na messaging dun sa NLEX.

3946
02:36:31,050 --> 02:36:32,630
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero hindi po nakikita kasi.

3947
02:36:33,290 --> 02:36:36,250
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So may mga iba't-ibang pamamaraan sila.

3948
02:36:36,370 --> 02:36:38,310
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May advisory sila sa social media.

3949
02:36:38,950 --> 02:36:40,290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hindi naman sila nagkulang.

3950
02:36:40,810 --> 02:36:44,890
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero sa tingin namin, hindi nakakarating sa ating mga motorista.

3951
02:36:45,730 --> 02:36:48,830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ganun din po, nakikiusap na rin po kami sa aming motorista.

3952
02:36:49,390 --> 02:36:50,850
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi alam na nila po.

3953
02:36:50,850 --> 02:36:54,930
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At hindi po na traffic na po at hindi nadadaanan ang ating NLEX ngayon.

3954
02:36:55,450 --> 02:37:02,870
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero po ang nangyayari, meron pang mga ibang motorista pa rin po na talagang gusto nila yung expressway na gamitin po.

3955
02:37:03,190 --> 02:37:13,290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At na naiintindihan namin kasi siguro yung mga ibang alternative routes natin ay baha po pagdating sa Pampanga at dito po sa pagtaas po ng Webaysia po.

3956
02:37:16,260 --> 02:37:18,340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you for sharing that.

3957
02:37:18,680 --> 02:37:21,400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Are you aware na tinaas na po yung NLEX previously?

3958
02:37:23,060 --> 02:37:24,920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po, tinaas po yan.

3959
02:37:26,240 --> 02:37:31,600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ngayon po, ang immediate nila is 0.6, itataas pa rin po I think, pati yung Tulao.

3960
02:37:32,080 --> 02:37:35,920
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya nga po, hindi dapat magtapos sa pagtataas lang ng kalsada.

3961
02:37:36,040 --> 02:37:40,840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi nakita na po natin to, ilang kalsada na po ang tinaas, ang nangyayari, lumit yung bahay.

3962
02:37:41,460 --> 02:37:42,840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At ganun pa rin ang baha.

3963
02:37:43,440 --> 02:37:50,040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So at least for the NLEX way po, kapag ito'y makakatulong, wala naman po problema sa amin sa DOTR.

3964
02:37:50,040 --> 02:37:51,680
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But it should not stop there.

3965
02:37:52,500 --> 02:37:53,040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The floodplains.

3966
02:37:53,060 --> 02:37:58,120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: The flood mitigation and flood measure, should that stop in just elevating the road po?

3967
02:37:58,440 --> 02:38:03,840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi hindi po yun ang talagang magiging solusyon para po matigil ang pagbabaha.

3968
02:38:04,960 --> 02:38:09,740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much and we agree with you, yung pagtataas po, hindi lang po yun yung solusyon.

3969
02:38:10,200 --> 02:38:11,840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It has to be a holistic program.

3970
02:38:12,500 --> 02:38:22,780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Last week, ganda ng timing, I brought this up po with, this has been brought up to me by the Climate Change Commission.

3971
02:38:23,060 --> 02:38:33,780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they mentioned po sa akin, being the district concerned po, no, that the flooding along the NLEX is, as you know, MacArthur is completely flooded.

3972
02:38:34,000 --> 02:38:36,340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: That is the alternative road to the NLEX ngayon po.

3973
02:38:36,740 --> 02:38:38,860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ngayon, umabot na sa NLEX yung problema.

3974
02:38:39,380 --> 02:38:44,700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I brought this up with Secretary Gibo Teodoro, mentioning it as a matter of national security.

3975
02:38:45,240 --> 02:38:48,540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At hindi lang po national security, that includes food security.

3976
02:38:48,540 --> 02:38:53,040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi kung ilang araw po na hindi po makadaan talaga sa NLEX, magkakaroon po tayo.

3977
02:38:53,060 --> 02:38:58,240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ang binanggit po niya was building an alternative expressway.

3978
02:38:58,700 --> 02:39:01,680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Can you shed your thoughts on this po?

3979
02:39:02,000 --> 02:39:05,840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po, yung ginagawa natin, the volume of water is just too much.

3980
02:39:06,240 --> 02:39:08,580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And the NLEX is really in a threatened position.

3981
02:39:11,060 --> 02:39:12,940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So basically, he wanted to build a new NLEX.

3982
02:39:13,060 --> 02:39:16,240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kung siya daw ang tatanungin, he wanted to build a new NLEX.

3983
02:39:17,940 --> 02:39:21,100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I have to confer with Secretary Guibot.

3984
02:39:21,100 --> 02:39:23,000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Alam ko na may pinanggagalingan siya.

3985
02:39:23,120 --> 02:39:24,160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maganda yung konsepto.

3986
02:39:24,160 --> 02:39:28,340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: But may mga questions on top of my mind right now, Mr. Chairman.

3987
