4082
02:45:48,480 --> 02:45:49,040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Baka next week,

4083
02:45:49,100 --> 02:45:51,460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Philippine Navy na po ang pinasasalamatan ko.

4084
02:45:51,880 --> 02:45:53,900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I personally had to leave my house by boat.

4085
02:45:54,360 --> 02:45:55,360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So what is our,

4086
